# Allowlist, not a denylist. The build context is everything sent to the
# Docker daemon; listing what to EXCLUDE means a new secret-bearing file
# (another .env, a database dump in backups/) is included until someone
# remembers to add it here. Listing what to INCLUDE fails the other way:
# a forgotten source directory breaks the build loudly instead.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!db/migrations/
